 to 4K, mouselook, rebindable controls, an adjustable field of view and a choice between Direct3D and OpenGL, plus an option to use either the newer Mac artwork or the old DOS artwork. Fan-made missions and mods are officially supported. It is single-player, and it suits players curious about the roots of immersive sims who are willing to accept an older design."}}